        "question_cLHAnz": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "2. Can I access the wipes without unfolding the pad?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The wipes pocket is accessible when the pad is open or folded. Insert a compatible wipes pack or reusable pouch with its opening aligned with the pocket opening.</p>",
            "default_open": false,
            "icon_code": "",
            "icon_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "question_LF7aE4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "&nbsp;3. Is the changing surface waterproof and easy to clean?&nbsp;",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The waterproof changing surface helps prevent moisture from passing through and wipes clean easily. Follow the product’s care instructions and allow it to dry completely before folding and storing.</p>",
            "default_open": false,
            "icon_code": "",
            "icon_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "question_KtVzDN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "&nbsp;4. Is it convenient for outings and travel?&nbsp;",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The pad folds into a compact shape for carrying in a diaper bag, and its straps and buckle loop provide additional carrying options. Unfold it on a stable, flat surface for diaper changes and always keep your baby within arm’s reach.</p>",
